# Load-test artifacts: keep the harness + text results + the PCAP captures.
# The full-run PCAP (~1.5 GB gz) is also published as a GitHub Release asset;
# it's tracked here too via Git LFS (see .gitattributes).
load-test/artifacts/*.pcap
load-test/artifacts/*.pid
load-test/artifacts/tcpdump.log
!load-test/artifacts/swiftpay-window.pcap.gz
!load-test/artifacts/swiftpay-loadtest.pcap.gz
